{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600090","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1360009001:1":{"text":"그래서 우리는 달빛호수 마을을 떠나 프라벨을 만나러 에메랄드 호수 마법 아카데미로 갔다...","source_cn":"于是，你们离开月湖村，前往翡湖学院拜访芙拉贝尔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F68006BF193E217","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360009002:1":{"text":"그럼, 얘들아, 작은 등롱은 다 만들었니?","source_cn":"那么，孩子们，大家都做好小灯笼了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84A92403F3CF29FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360009003:0":{"text":"진작에 다 했어요! 제가 제일 먼저 했어요!","source_cn":"早就做完啦！第一个做完的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B594CED7096E1A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360009004:1":{"text":"응, 토토가 제일 빠르네!","source_cn":"嗯，淘淘速度最快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50C126B32BF12C7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360009005:1":{"text":"하지만 자세히 보면 더 잘 만들 수 있는 부분이 많아 보여. 이 이음새의 풀을 잎으로 덮으면 더 깔끔해 보이지 않을까?","source_cn":"不过仔细看看，很多地方可以做得更好呢，如果把接缝处的胶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EE2A4349202EE15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360009006:1":{"text":"알겠어요...! 가서 고쳐볼게요!","source_cn":"我知道啦……！我再去改改！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08E5C66A45EB30BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360009007:1":{"text":"저도 완성했어요, 프라벨 선생님!","source_cn":"我也做好啦，芙拉贝尔老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3095A28D7E393C68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360009008:1":{"text":"라라는 속도가 좀 느리긴 하지만, 훨씬 꼼꼼하게 만들었네. 어디 보자... 등롱의 뼈대를 좀 튼튼하게 만들면 어떨까? 그렇게 하면 처마에 걸어둬도 바람에 날아가지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"乐乐的速度稍微慢了点，但做得仔细多了，我看看……灯笼骨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800B58333E19D9C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1360009009:1":{"text":"좋아요! 제 등롱은 더 완벽해질 거예요!","source_cn":"没问题！我的灯笼一定精益求精！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B10AE12293F5D30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1360009010:1":{"text":"흑, 선생님, 전 아직...","source_cn":"呜，老师，我还差一点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8BD3D03424B0EB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360009011:1":{"t